OL,3,GNEWSADetectorists asked to track down
OL,4,Alate mum's ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectorists are being asked to help a
OL,7,Fman who lost his late mother's ring
OL,8,Fwhile on a walk in her memory.
OL,10,FTaz Brotherton, from Manningtree,
OL,11,FEssex, was visiting one of his mum
OL,12,FSally's favourite places, Pin Mill in
OL,13,FSuffolk, with his four brothers to
OL,14,Fwatch the sunrise about two weeks ago.
OL,16,FThe 38-year-old said he was "totally
OL,17,Fdevastated" when he realised the ring
OL,18,Fwas lost.
OL,20,FBrotherton said he had worn the ring
OL,21,Fevery day since she gave it to him
OL,22,Fbefore her death three months ago.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
